        "code": "SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER",
        "text": "Historical teammate DRIVE->PNR cells had n=30–70; many were labeled DIRECTIONAL. The question 'any teammate DRIVE' would pool all pairings, but to reach adequate power (>0.8) for a small effect in the presence of large game-level variance, a far larger number of sequences would be needed."
