        "code": "LABEL_ERROR",
        "text": "DRIVE PPP is systematically understated by ~12pp due to foul leakage (only 0.7% of possessions map via initiation_type). This bias can create or inflate apparent sequential premiums. PNR labeling may shift across contexts, further compromising the outcome variable."
